sed to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'Two-stage framework': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A framework proposed for TinyBERT learning.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'KD method for Transformer-based distillation': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The new knowledge distillation method introduced for Transformer-based distillation, which is a key contribution of the paper.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'MNLI Dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['The dataset used for the MNLI task, likely referring to the Multi-Genre Natural Language Inference dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'MRPC Dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['The dataset used for the MRPC task, likely referring to the Microsoft Research Paraphrase Corpus dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'Question Answering Datasets': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['Datasets used for evaluating the question answering tasks. The specific datasets are not mentioned, but this refers to the data used to evaluate the question answering performance.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'BERT LARGE': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A larger BERT model that can be used as a teacher model for TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'XLNet LARGE': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A larger XLNet model that can be used as a teacher model for TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'NLP applications': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The target application area for BERT-based models, particularly on edge devices.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'Knowledge transfer': {'type': ['task', 'task'], 'description': ['The process of transferring knowledge from teacher models (e.g., BERT LARGE, XLNet LARGE) to student models (TinyBERT).', 'The objective of transferring knowledge from a teacher model to a student model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13, 16]}, 'Pruning': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A technique used to further compress