_index': [3, 12]}, 'Embedding layer output': {'description': ['The output of the embedding layer in BERT, used in the distillation process.', 'The output of the embedding layer, which is used as a component in the proposed Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Hidden states': {'description': ['Representations derived from the Transformer layers, used in the distillation process.', 'The hidden states derived from the Transformer layer, used as a component in the proposed Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Attention matrices': {'description': ['Matrices representing attention weights in the Transformer layers, used in the distillation process.', 'An intermediate representation within the Transformer model, used in attention-based distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 6]}, 'Logits output': {'description': ['The output of the prediction layer in BERT, used in the distillation process.', 'The logits output by the prediction layer, used as a component in the proposed Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Linguistic knowledge': {'description': ['The knowledge of language captured by the attention weights of BERT.', 'The knowledge of language structure and meaning encoded in the teacher BERT model.'], 'type': ['task'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 4]}, 'Attention Matrices': {'description': ['The attention matrices derived from the Transformer layer, used as a component in the proposed Transformer distillation method.', 'An intermediate representation within the Transformer model, used in attention-based distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 6]}, 'teacher-student learning': {'description': ['A learning paradigm where a smaller student model learns from a larger teacher model.', 'The objective of transferring knowledge from a teacher model (BERT) to a student model (TinyBERT) through dist