e of distillation applied to the prediction layer of the Transformer model.', 'A distillation process applied to the prediction layer of the model.', 'A distillation technique applied for 3 epochs in task-specific distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 6, 7]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ['A distillation approach that fine-tunes TinyBERT using task-specific datasets.', 'A distillation approach applied to augmented datasets for specific tasks.', 'A distillation method focused on transferring task-specific knowledge from a fine-tuned teacher model.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 11, 14, 7]}, 'Data Augmentation Method': {'description': ['The specific method used to extend the task-specific training set. The text mentions a "new data augmentation method" but doesn\'t specify the method itself.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 7]}, 'Data augmentation': {'description': ['The process of increasing the amount of data by adding modified copies of existing data.', 'A method proposed in the text.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method', 'task'], 'source_chunk_index': [8, 11, 13]}, 'General Distillation': {'description': ['A specific type of distillation method used in the study, providing a good initialization for task-specific distillation.', 'A technique used in TinyBERT learning, including general and task-specific distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [8, 13]}, 'Task-Specific Distillation': {'description': ['A specific type of distillation method used in the study, which further improves TinyBERT by focusing on learning task-specific knowledge.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [8, 11]}, 'Appendix A': {'description': ['The appendix where more details of the data augmentation procedure are discussed.', 